# Translations for locales the toc does not currently load. Kept so the work
# is not lost; wire them up or delete them deliberately, not by drift.
# addon-check: allow-orphan Locales/*/*.lua
# addon-check: allow-orphan Locales/strings.lua
# The GO model viewer pulls in AzerothAdmin_Models with LoadAddOn. It is a
# top-level addon folder (sibling of this one), not nested here: WoW only scans
# Interface/AddOns/<folder>, so a nested addon is never seen. It used to live in
# _build/, which is why that viewer could not load on this fork's deployment.
